      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Please feel free to call on either Mr. Drabkin (566-6886) or Mr. Kriegel (566-7787) during this period to discuss any problems or to explore the potential of any Federal programs. The Washington office can obtain for you copies of legislation and rules and regulations. There is also a file of this material in Mr. Kriegel's office in City Hall.",
