      "text": "Please notify either Mr. Drabkin or Mr. Kriegel of any other Federal aid problems you may have either with grant applications or with pending legislation. The Washington office will from time to time be sending copies of pending legislation to the Federal Programs Officer designated by you for comment and analysis.",
